{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/db196206e1a4018fc899a8daa9c5b788.avif?t=1774073894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/db196206e1a4018fc899a8daa9c5b788.webp?t=1774073894 width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your path through a roguelike realm torn apart by divine war. Build powerful party synergies and fight through unforgiving battles as you explore and save the realm. When one run ends in death, resurrection begins the next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/952889894234237c20a95c920ac4baec.poster.avif?t=1774073894\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/952889894234237c20a95c920ac4baec.webm?t=1774073894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/952889894234237c20a95c920ac4baec.mp4?t=1774073894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/d22c08096f7d6b275a6f1080736040ae.avif?t=1774073894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/d22c08096f7d6b275a6f1080736040ae.webp?t=1774073894 width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn Ultimate Charge from every move, whether attacking, casting spells, or defending.\u00a0Each hero wields a unique Ultimate Ability to turn the tide\u2014breaking enemy ranks, empowering allies, or unleashing overwhelming force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/385af80eafb1b293bccfcd1c34813d79.avif?t=1774073894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/385af80eafb1b293bccfcd1c34813d79.webp?t=1774073894 width=1560 height=243 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/9683a40e3805b57f0134814b2b57a632.avif?t=1774073894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/9683a40e3805b57f0134814b2b57a632.webp?t=1774073894 width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn new abilities, equip powerful items, and gain mechanic-changing Blessings to forge unique builds each run. Upgrades don\u2019t just raise stats; they evolve abilities, unlock new mechanics, and deepen hero playstyles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/89c90d0b4bb8bb801f85342002acb457.avif?t=1774073894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/89c90d0b4bb8bb801f85342002acb457.webp?t=1774073894 width=1560 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory depends on how you combine your heroes: chain their powers, create devastating synergies, and unlock artifacts that empower your entire party.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.poster.avif?t=1774073894\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.webm?t=1774073894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/b317caea5c2f990a149664c0646b6028.mp4?t=1774073894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras/8d31f423f561ff769434498e1765db40.avif?t=1774073894\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/extras_big/8d31f423f561ff769434498e1765db40.webp?t=1774073894 width=1560 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead your champions alone or rally up to three friends in fast-paced co-op play. With simultaneous turns for all players, battles remain fluid, tactical, and unrelenting as you fight for the realm\u2019s survival together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560360?t=1774073894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560360?t=1774073894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/5b5324cb29c8ccdb2f2f7c80d90d6bbdc8d2896e/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774073894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560360/5b5324cb29c8ccdb2f2f7c80d90d6bbdc8d2896e/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1774073894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Su